{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“幂零完备化”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"幂零完备化"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $E$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"环谱","text":"环谱"}},{"Plain":", $X$ 为谱, 取 $X$ 的 $E$-"},{"Local":{"url":"Adams消解","text":"Adams 消解"}},{"Plain":" $X_\\bullet \\to X$, 称其同伦极限 $\\lim_n X_n$ 为 $X$ 关于 $E$ 的幂零完备化 (nilpotent completion).</p>\n"}]}}